<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo prices 1.0 bln mark Dec 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo prices 1.0 bln mark Dec 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced</p>
<p>earlier by joint lead managers BHF Bank, Commerzbank, Deutsche</p>
<p>Morgan Grenfell and Dresdner Kleinwort Benson has been priced.</p>
<p>BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK HANNOVER</p>
<p>AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    20.DEC.02</p>
<p>TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.53     PAY DATE   *04.JUL.97</p>
<p>REOFFER    98.53     SPREAD	FLAT     LISTING    HANNOVER</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.375 PERCENT DEC 2002 TREUHAND</p>
<p>NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 724</p>
<p>	     *PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
